Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.04,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\c&H4907D6&\bord0\shad0\pos(320,136)\fs16}Watch out\Nfor wild boars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:23.04,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Koenji! What the hell \Nare you doing up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:29.36,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,The truly superior belong \Nin high places, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.31,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:36.60,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,What the hell is that freak doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.87,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Damn it. I'll call him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:40.94,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Did you hurt it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:44.78,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,No wonder. It's an unfamiliar mountain path, \Nnine kilometers each way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:46.77,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,This idiot's dragging us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.78,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I thought he was supposed \Nto be our group leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.77,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Just leave us out of your failure, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:59.40,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Why can't I do this right, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.42,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,C'mon, hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.01,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You can lean on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.58,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll see if I can fetch Koenji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:08.51,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,This is going to make you both late, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:13.82,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Letting you aggravate your injury will \Nmake things worse for us on test day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:16.31,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Right, Ayanokoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:21.57,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Sorry, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.55,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Koenji?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:36.08,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,If it isn't little boy Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:40.26,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,As you can see, I was enjoying \Na bit of sport with this boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:43.96,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:45.49,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I'll return later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:48.71,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Or was there something you needed me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:50.84,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's about the day of the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:53.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd like you to help the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:57.47,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of that for a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:02:00.72,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,But it's not you who dictates my behavior...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:03.85,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,It is I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:11.61,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:13.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:18.37,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,The true identity of the one who \Ngot Dragon Boy to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:23.11,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,You do an excellent job feigning ignorance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:26.67,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,but the passion in your trembling \Narm tells me all I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:29.38,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I think you're seeing \Nthings that aren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:31.17,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:34.61,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I have no plans of revealing your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:40.01,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Regardless, I intend to follow \Nmy heart at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:48.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like anyone can get to him.
