Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.24,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.99,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of meat is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.03,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,They got an unexpected delivery of boar meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:29.61,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Whoa, so it's like game meat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:30.68,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,G-Game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.25,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,But who brought the boar in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:32.58,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:36.92,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Probably some local hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:41.94,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.36,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Did you drop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.43,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:50.40,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.45,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I really could have lost this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:55.94,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're the one who found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.37,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:05:01.45,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,You stood out in the relay \Nwith Horikita-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.22,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,And Miyabi—Oh, you wouldn't \Nknow him by that name...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:07.83,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,President Nagumo has his eye on you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:11.29,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Running is the only real skill I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:15.73,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Do you think there's a way to get \NNagumo-senpai's eye off of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.27,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Maybe you could beat him at something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:24.13,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I'd love to see Miyabi \Nknocked down a peg, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:25.24,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:28.35,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose that is one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.31,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez, it was just a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:38.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Would it be a problem for you \Nif Nagumo-senpai were beaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.88,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:49.71,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You don't seem as enamored with \NNagumo Miyabi as the other second-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.62,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:57.25,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I have a history with Miyabi, you could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:01.83,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:03.80,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,As thanks for returning my charm,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.28,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I'll tell you anything you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.29,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What I'd like to know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:13.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,is what happened when the \Ngirls divided into groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:32.13,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Hey, Ishizaki. You got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:33.93,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.76,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,There's just two days to the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.95,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,We're gonna be in trouble at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:41.50,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:44.43,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn if I'm expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:49.88,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I played soccer in elementary \Nand middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.68,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,The hell's that got to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:56.73,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,It was the kind of school that \Nmade it to nationals every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:01.19,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,and while I wasn't exactly \Nan ace, I was pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:03.87,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You just wanna brag about how great you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:07.95,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,But while everyone else was aiming \Npassionately for nationals,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.56,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I found myself feeling detached from it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:12.95,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Like I didn't belong there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:18.04,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,But you're not in the soccer club now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:21.97,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Yeah, see, I had a tendency \Nto hide out and smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:25.29,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,So they caught you and kicked you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:28.03,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Nah, I was really good at hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.62,0:07:32.60,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,But I felt this kind of \Nalienation the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:35.39,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,So I quit soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.08,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I regret it sometimes, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:41.11,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I look at the guys in the \Nsoccer club and think,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.37,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,"maybe I could've been part of that."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.98,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,What about you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.64,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,What've you got in your pasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.57,Main,Ishizuka,0,0,0,,Huh? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:54.35,Main,Ishizuka,0,0,0,,I don't have squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:08:00.65,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I've done nothing but \Nstudy since I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.13,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I was awful at sports,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:08.51,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,and I couldn't see the point \Nin trying to get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.72,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,And that's why you're \Nso good at school stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:17.92,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Yeah. I thought my academic skills were \Ngood enough to get me into Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:22.15,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,But I ended up in Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.42,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I resented that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:28.54,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,But next thing I know, \Nmy polar opposite, Sudo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:32.16,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,has been helping the class \Nway more than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:39.72,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Right now, I feel... just like I did at \Nthe island exam and the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:43.63,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I'm completely mortified.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.63,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Hey, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.46,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ishizaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:51.93,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be your leader, \Nbut I'm hardly acting like a role model.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.94,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,What a load of crap. \NDon't apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:09:01.94,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, it ticks me off \Nwhen you order me around...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:04.53,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,But it's not like anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:08.40,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,was gonna take responsibility \Nfor this bunch of misfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.15,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Ishizaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:14.44,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Being in a group of ruffians \Nisn't as bad as you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:16.14,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Who're you calling a ruffian?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We're kinda trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:21.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:22.74,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Family!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.26,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Go rest, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.56,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:49.44,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,It'll be worse for us if \Nyou can't run on test day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:52.52,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,In exchange, you'd better \Ncarry us on the written exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.97,0:09:54.90,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Score 120% or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.65,0:09:58.43,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Commendable behavior, my delinquent friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.20,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Shut up! You wanna die today, Koenji?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.59,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Everyone. Regarding tomorrow's marathon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:11.46,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I thought up a plan I'd \Nlike to share with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.97,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,A plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:17.72,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Everyone in the group has a minimum \Ndistance they have to run in the relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:20.34,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,But as long as that's achieved,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:23.76,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,there's nothing forbidding certain students \Nfrom running the excess distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:28.48,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,So you want to let the best \Nrunners run most of the course?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:29.43,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:31.85,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Of course, it's a mountain path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:33.86,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,It'll be asking a lot of you guys, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:35.30,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:38.12,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I'll run all your extra distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.08,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I'm down for that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:42.26,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I can handle some distance running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.25,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:44.93,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,How about you, Albert?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:47.55,Main,Ishizuka,0,0,0,,Well, he's fast enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:50.04,Main,Ishizuka,0,0,0,,but he's weirdly lacking in stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.52,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:55.65,Main_Top,Ishizaka,0,0,0,,He's amazing at dashing down \Na steep decline, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:55.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll do the best I can, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.14,Main_Top,Albert,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.14,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,You're sure, Kiyotaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:58.91,Main_Top,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.64,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Just don't get your hopes up too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:00.46,Main_Top,Totsuka,0,0,0,,He's down for the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:03.37,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,The rest is up to Koenji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:06.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Though I doubt you'll be able \Nto convince him to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:09.15,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,We'll just have to wing it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.61,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,Our leader's got his work cut out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.95,Main_Top,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Mii-chan, you're in \NIchinose-san's group, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:23.15,Main_Top,Shinohara,0,0,0,,You're the only one from our class, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.96,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.96,Main_Top,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Is that hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.05,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Sudo-kun, you never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.92,Main_Top,Wang,0,0,0,,No, everyone's been really nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:28.92,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,You all seem to be doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.13,Main_Top,Hirata,0,0,0,,If you need any help, just ask, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:34.05,Main_Top,Wang,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hirata-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting there crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:50.52,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,I-I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:53.25,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you worried about tomorrow's test?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:58.41,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,It's Horikita-kun I'm worried for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.70,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Does that man ever worry about anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:05.60,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,Horikita-kun... has been fighting \Non his own all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:10.42,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,Because the rest of us always drag him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:14.67,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,He's always sacrificed himself \Nto protect the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:21.13,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,Even now, he's carrying the fight with \NNagumo-kun entirely on his own shoulders...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:26.81,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,But we can't do anything to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:31.01,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're really not having \Nany problems of your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:32.66,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,You don't give up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:34.05,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,It's really nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:35.86,Main,Akane,0,0,0,,Just forget this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.41,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Hashimoto and Ryuen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.14,0:13:25.74,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's hard to tell what they're \Nsaying at this distance.
