Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.14,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The day of the four tests arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.89,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,250)\an8\fs30\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Test 2: Written Exam
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:47.14,Italics_Top,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,In the written exam, \NYukimura carried his weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:50.64,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,80)\an8\fs30\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Test 3: Speech
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.64,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The speech exam also went smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:56.40,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But the real deciding factor \Nwould be, as expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:14:02.40,Main,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,20)\an8\fs30\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Test 4: Marathon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.31,0:14:02.01,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,the marathon, where placement \Nwould make a huge difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:05.13,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,166)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Yukimura's Group\N First Runner: Sumida
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.87,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Ichi Springs\N Oshin River
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:12.12,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,1)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Second Runner: Moriyama
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:18.13,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,1)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Third Runner: Totsuka
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:20.13,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs24\shad0\bord2\3c&HCDC2B4&\c&H3D3125&\frx6\fry30\fay.3\pos(312.667,14.667)}Usagimori Jizo  Mt. Rea Summit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:22.72,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,1)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Fourth Runner: Hashimoto
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:28.19,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,166)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Fifth Runner: Albert
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:30.28,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Albert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:49.66,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,1)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Sixth Runner: Ishizaki
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:56.17,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(208,1)\pos(320,20)\an8\fs24\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\3c&H2F2E2C&}Seventh Runner: Yukimura
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.67,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Yukimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:11.54,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You made me run extra, so you'd \Nbetter give this all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.08,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:33.97,Main,Student A,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:34.97,Main,Student B,0,0,0,,We're still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:21.75,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:25.29,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll work up a bit of a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:31.89,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,You all did well over the eight \Ndays of this training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:35.14,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,The average score was \Nbetter than last year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:39.34,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,All of the boys' groups \Nexceeded the borderline,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:41.40,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,so no one will be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:43.52,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:46.88,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I always knew we'd get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:48.28,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:52.28,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,Incidentally, the highest overall \Nscore came from Class 3-A,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.60,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,Horikita Manabu's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:56.18,Main,Fujimaki,0,0,0,,You did it, Horikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:06.05,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Horikita-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:08.30,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,That's very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:11.05,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,It seems you lost, Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:14.68,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Well... that's up for debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.11,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the girls' groups...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:23.02,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there was one group \Nthat fell under the borderline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:29.19,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,The group led by Ikari Momoko of Class 3-B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.20,Main,Fujimaki,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do, Nagumo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:43.99,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Fujimaki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.46,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,They're still announcing results.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:50.67,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Why is Fujimaki-senpai of Class A so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.28,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,The group leader was in Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:56.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The issue isn't the leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:59.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,but who she's taking with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:05.11,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Ikari will be expelled, \Nalong with a student she designates
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:06.48,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,as sharing responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.39,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,Ikari, who do you designate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:11.11,Main,Ikari,0,0,0,,Who do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.76,0:18:14.80,Main,Ikari,0,0,0,,The one who disrupted the \Nharmony of our group...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.74,Main,Ikari,0,0,0,,Tachibana Akane-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.70,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It was all a trap by Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:24.02,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The duel was a distraction \Nfrom his real objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:27.63,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,His target from the start \Nwas Tachibana Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:33.39,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Nagumo used girls loyal to \Nhis faction to create a group
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:37.28,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,specifically designed to fall under \Nthe borderline and take Tachibana out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:41.74,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Tachibana, why didn't you ask me for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:43.43,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:48.13,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,I knew I would be a burden to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.19,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:52.70,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Friendship is a beautiful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:55.45,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Or should I call it "love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:59.45,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Tell me {\i1}all{\i0} about how you feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.89,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Are you more annoyed than \Nyou've ever been before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:05.83,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Why is Tachibana the one you targeted?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:12.59,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I was just dying to see your \Nface when I got rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:16.92,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,That indulgence of your curiosity \Nhas cost you something dear, Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:21.63,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Even if we did things differently, \NI still trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:25.10,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,And I'm choosing to throw \Nthat trust in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:29.28,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I'll expel as many people as I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:33.36,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,That's how things are meant \Nto be done at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:35.85,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Nagumo's maliciousness won the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:43.34,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But I doubt Horikita Manabu considered \NTachibana an indispensable pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:50.25,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You're talking as if Tachibana \Nis going to be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:52.46,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:57.16,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,There's something I wish \Nto spend points to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.14,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Horikita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:02.62,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Wow, I thought we'd come out of this even.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:08.65,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,You're really going to spend all those \Npoints to save Tachibana-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:11.51,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Please, don't! I've brought this on myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:13.27,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Do you mind, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.09,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:20.28,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,You're effectively handing \Nover your standing as Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:24.95,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Only until I take it back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.41,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Horikita-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:30.17,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Well, that's just fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:37.12,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I guess Nagumo isn't the \Nonly one with two faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.99,0:20:42.94,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It's absolutely unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:45.93,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I can't believe he cooked \Nup a crazy plan like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:51.20,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,If I were that Ikari girl, \NI'd never volunteer to be expelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:54.26,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Well, Ikari won't actually be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:55.94,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:58.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,For the same reason as Tachibana Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:01.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,She'll be saved from expulsion through the \Nexpenditure of large amounts of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:06.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Nagumo would have agreed to cover that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:09.71,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Does that mean Nagumo-senpai \Nlost a lot from this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.88,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The second-years are a monolith under Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:16.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,They can easily afford it \Nby pooling their resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:21.71,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But Horikita Manabu has to pay \Nwith only one class's funds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:23.39,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,so it's a more serious blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:26.72,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It's such a reckless way to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.40,0:21:31.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's how Nagumo Miyabi fights, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:33.76,Main,Other Class A,0,0,0,,You didn't forget anything, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:36.73,Main,Other Class B,0,0,0,,I said I checked. Just trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.30,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I guess we'd better split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:41.78,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Wait, tell me one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:46.74,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,If I ended up in the same situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:48.75,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What do you think you would—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:50.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let you be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:54.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:01.41,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What was to follow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:07.22,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,was a series of expulsions from \NAdvanced Nurturing High School
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.33,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,involving all class years.
